<title>EGYPT: Egypt says seeks 110,000T US/Australian hard wheat.</title>
<headline>Egypt says seeks 110,000T US/Australian hard wheat.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Egyptian state Holding Co for Rice and Flour Mills said Friday it wanted to buy 110,000 tonnes of U.S. hard red winter wheat, No. 2 or better, or Australian hard wheat.</p>
<p>It said it wanted the wheat in two consignments:</p>
<p>-- 55,000 tonnes for shipment February 5 to 15</p>
<p>-- 55,000 tonnes for shipment March 1 to 10</p>
<p>Prices should be quoted both FOB and C+F Mediterranean Egyptian ports. The deadline for bids is 1100 local/0900 GMT Jan 27.</p>
<p>--Jonathan Wright +20 2 578 3290/1</p>
</text>
